    "detail": {
      "id": 1350203,
      "name": "[Aria] Hear the Present",
      "desc": "<color=#2BAD00>Aria's <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist: Harmony of Delusion</color> is triggered</color> when an enemy enters an Attribute Anomaly while Aria is off field. When a heavy attack is landed with <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist: Harmony of Delusion</color>, it can trigger the Abloom effect of Core Passive: Innate Stage Presence. Further, should the <color=#FFFFFF>Fandom Power</color> nearby be equal or greater than 2, she may proceed to launching the third hit of <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Perfect Pitch</color> after the attack. <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Assist: Harmony of Delusion</color> can trigger once every 8s.",
